        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Craig Melville, Grover Jones, David Curry\n- Places: Rosedale, Indiana; West Terre Haute, Indiana; Hollywood, California\n- Works: “Northcote (So Hungover)”\n- Organizations: Triple J, YouTube\n- Roles: television comedy director, film clip director, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Grover Jones was born in Rosedale, Indiana, grew up in West Terre Haute, Indiana, and died in Hollywood, California.\n- Craig James Melville is an Australian television comedy director.\n- “Northcote (So Hungover)” was a notable radio hit on the national broadcaster Triple J.\n- The film clip for “Northcote (So Hungover)” was directed by Craig Melville and produced by David Curry.\n- The film clip for “Northcote (So Hungover)” received over 500,000 views on YouTube.",
